  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks, Performance sphere ((lyric) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you would use a lyric on a creature, you may spend 1 use of skill leverage to delay its effects for up to a number of hours equal to your ranks in Perform (comedy, oratory, or sing).</p>\n<p>At any point during this time, the target may trigger its effects as a swift action, beginning the effects of the lyric. A target can only be under the effects of one delayed lyric at a time, but may benefit from another lyric during this time, as long as they are only benefiting from one lyric as normal (unless you possess an ability that allows otherwise). The delayed lyric cannot be triggered if the creature is already affected by a lyric.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
